WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.288 --> 00:00:01.790
(whooshing)

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:04.330
- [Woman] Bobsledding is
a Winter Olympic sport

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:06.340
where you have your driver and you have

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:07.830
a brakeman, which is my position.

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:10.380
The brakeman is mainly
the engine to the sled.

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:12.281
We get it goin' as fast as possible.

00:00:12.281 --> 00:00:14.470
(rustling)
(whooshing)

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:17.456
I am Aja Evans, and I'm
an Olympic bobsledder.

00:00:17.456 --> 00:00:21.700
(dramatic orchestral music)

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:24.940
The track is about a mile
long, and full of twists

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:27.560
and turns, and it can get up to 90 miles an hour.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:30.890
Th moment I zip up my speed suit,

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:32.710
I feel like a complete superhero.

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:35.390
It's almost like I here
the theme music in my head.

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:36.649
I'm ready to go.

00:00:36.649 --> 00:00:38.899
(rattling)

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:50.257
(clattering)

00:01:04.615 --> 00:01:07.095
(digital sound wave)

00:01:07.095 --> 00:01:08.710
(beeping)

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:10.660
As we're going to track, pickin' up speed,

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:12.280
we start to pull about five Gs,

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:14.690
which is five times the force a gravity.

00:01:14.690 --> 00:01:17.720
So, it's literally what a
fighter pilot experiences.

00:01:18.679 --> 00:01:23.596
(rustling)
(nervous music)

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:28.130
It's like someone's jumping on you,

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:29.710
'cause out of nowhere, you just feel

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:31.417
all this pressure on your lower back.

00:01:31.417 --> 00:01:33.667
(scraping)

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.980
It's a pretty noisy ride.

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:40.610
My head is rattling throughout the sled.

00:01:40.610 --> 00:01:42.040
I'm tryin' to stay low.

00:01:43.281 --> 00:01:45.531
(rustling)

00:01:51.345 --> 00:01:53.000
As soon as it's over, I can inhale

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:54.600
and start breathin' again.

00:02:01.364 --> 00:02:03.781
(sonic wave)

